        "jsCode": "dnationStatistics = items[0].json.text;\ndnationStatistics = \"=========Statistics of user donations to streamers====\\n\\n\"+dnationStatistics+\"\\n\\n\\n\";\n\ndonationTrend = items[1].json.text;\ndonationTrend = \"=========Trends of user donations to streamers=====\\n\\n\"+donationTrend+\"\\n\\n\\n\";\n\n\n\nconst allText = [dnationStatistics, donationTrend].join(\"\\n\\n\\n\");\n\n// const allText = [giftText, latencyText, mysqlCpuLoading].join(\"\\n\\n\\n\");\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      mergedText: allText\n    }\n  }\n];"
